# Fixed defect 2432, 2026-11-10, lane b30-pkg, a shape beside it: a `use`
# holding an address whose last part is a keyword, `match`.
#
# SYMPTOM: `use_holds_an_address`, *`use <match>/parse`, `match` standing
# for the entry the catalogue gives that address*, with a repair writing
# `<match>/parse`, a line the parser refuses at `match`.
#
# CAUSE: the entry an address is likeliest written under was its last part
# wherever that has an entry's shape, a keyword included.
#
# FIX: a last part no `use` writes between `<` `>` offers no entry: the
# message names the stand-in, `json`, and no repair is offered.
use github.com/acme/match/parse  #~ use_holds_an_address

function main()
    print(1)
